ra una tabla de madera del tamaño de un movil, el marihuano no le prestaba mucha atención pero de pronto el vagabundo se bajó en una estacion y el marihuano se quedó mirando la puerta todo el recorrido sin mover un solo dedo, como si su alma se hubiese bajado con el vagabundo oficinista y su cuerpo se quedó ahi, inmovil.\r\n\r\nMe bajé en mi estacion y el marihuano ahi seguia sin moverse. Si alguien lo ve ayudenle a recuperar su alma perdida.", "timestamp_created": 1714442150, "timestamp_updated": 1714442150, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "163859993", "author": {"steamid": "76561198338099752", "personaname": "salva_putas_3000ML", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198338099752/", "num_games_owned": 57, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 223, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 223, "last_played": 1714017090, "avatar": "97f57b58d639bf7e7f0de30ba44f013c32281139"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "ta bueno", "timestamp_created": 1714416544, "timestamp_updated": 1714416544, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.514761447906494141", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}